# HCS Source Manifest

Machine-readable list of every source in `/old`. Consumers (`ziptastic`,
build scripts, CI) read this file — **do not move rows around without
updating consumers.**

Columns:
- **id** — directory name under `old/`
- **url** — canonical upstream repository
- **pin** — commit SHA or tag currently vendored (`TBD` until first build)
- **license** — SPDX identifier or `verify`
- **integration** — `link` | `copy-src` | `external-process` | `reference`

